hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2753","###
 Yusuf ibn Musa narrated to us, saying: Jarir narrated to us, from Ata' ibn al-Sa'ib, from Abdullah ibn Ubayd ibn Umair, from his father. And Ali ibn al-Mundhir narrated to us, saying: Ibn Fudail narrated to us, saying: Ata' ibn al-Sa'ib narrated to us, from Abdullah ibn Ubayd ibn Umair, from his father, who said to Abdullah ibn Umar: ""You indeed jostle"
